Subject: [PATCH] fix(r2): record current PRODUCT_CONTEXT.uk.md hash so
 check_context.py --final passes

Commit 561f3d8 added the V5 legal chain E1-E5 section to
docs/context-20260916/PRODUCT_CONTEXT.uk.md (+14 lines) but did not update
RECONCILIATION.json. Since then the documented R2 gate

    python -B docs/context-20260916/check_context.py --final

has failed with: artifact drift: docs/context-20260916/PRODUCT_CONTEXT.uk.md

Recorded hash was the pre-561f3d8 content (fa9856b6...). This records the
current content hash (47c6a310...). No document content is changed.
Verified: check_context.py --final -> PASS_FINAL_CONTEXT.
